CB007449_PUCCH_coverage_extension_TDD_beamforming
    [Documentation]
    ...  Test case verifies feature CB007449 with coverage extension activation based on given counters.
    ...  Measurement results with the feature enabled should be at least equal to or better than the measurement results with the feature disabled.
    ...  One of counters list to verify (expected_equal_or_greater_counters or expected_equal_or_lower_counters) must be defined at least.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory) : configuration id of NR cell to perform throughput transission and counters check, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param dict attenuator_info: (Mandatory) : attenuator info defined as attenuator object in init file, e.g.: ${tl.attenuators[0]}
    ...  :param dict attenuator_config: (Mandatory) : attenuator configuration with all defined ports and mandatory 'UL' mode for each one, e.g.:
    ...                                 config_CB009514_NRCELL_0 = {
    ...                                               "ports": [{"antenna": "ANTL-1", "port": 1, "OFF": 63, "DL": 0, "UL": 0},
    ...                                                         {"antenna": "ANTL-2", "port": 2, "OFF": 63, "DL": 0, "UL": 0},
    ...                                                         {"antenna": "ANTL-3", "port": 3, "OFF": 63, "DL": 0, "UL": 0},
    ...                                                         {"antenna": "ANTL-4", "port": 4, "OFF": 63, "DL": 0, "UL": 0}]}
    ...  :param str att_value_to_call_drop: (Mandatory) : value of attenuation (in dB) of each antenna port for tested cell which will drop the
    ...                                                   l3 call, e.g.: 40. Attenuation of antenna ports will increase during the test.
    ...                                                   Maximum attenuation level should cause transmission termination and UE detach.
    ...  :param dict throughput: (Mandatory) : dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                        it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                                        defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                                        Example:
    ...                                           {
    ...                                             '827736065':
    ...                                                   {
    ...                                                      'throughput':
    ...                                                          {
    ...                                                              'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                              'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                          },
    ...                                                      'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                                  },
    ...                                         }
    ...  :param str protocol: (Optional) : data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...  :param str udp_buffer: (Optional) : monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...  :param dict ue_network_modes: (Optional) : dictionary with pairs of UE Serial Number - desired network mode e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only", "SN321": "NR_only}
    ...                                             possible network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE (NR_LTE mode CAN NOT be used with any of the other
    ...                                             two in case of more than one UE); defaults to ${None} (current modes set on UEs will be used)
    ...  :param str measurement_interval: (Optional) : measurement interval defined in minutes, related to single measurement frame duration
    ...                                                set in SCF configuration. One of following values possible to set:
    ...                                                5min, 15min, 30min, or 60min, defaults to 5min.
    ...  :param list expected_equal_or_greater_counters: (Mandatory/Optional) : list of counters IDs whose values with activated feature
    ...                                                                         should be greater or equal to values with deactivated feature.
    ...                                                                         Defaults to @{EMPTY} menas expected_equal_or_lower_counters
    ...                                                                         argument must be defined as a non-empty list.
    ...  :param list expected_equal_or_lower_counters: (Mandatory/Optional) : list of counters IDs whose values with activated feature
    ...                                                                       should be lower or equal to values with deactivated feature.
    ...                                                                       Defaults to @{EMPTY} menas expected_equal_or_greater_counters
    ...                                                                       argument must be defined as a non-empty list.

    [Arguments]    ${cell_id}
    ...            ${attenuator_info}
    ...            ${attenuator_config}
    ...            ${att_value_to_call_drop}
